From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Glathe <jens.glathe@oldschoolsolutions.biz>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 11:28:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] UBUNTU: SAUCE: dt-bindings: arm: qcom: Distinguish IdeaCentre
 Mini 01Q8X10 SKUs

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2167217

The Lenovo IdeaCentre Mini 01Q8X10 exists on both X1E80100 (Hamoa) and
X1P42100 (Purwa). A single two-entry compatible cannot tell those
device trees apart.

Move the board out of the generic X1E80100 enum and document two
three-entry lists:

  lenovo,hamoa-ideacentre-mini-01q8x10, lenovo,ideacentre-mini-01q8x10,
  qcom,x1e80100

  lenovo,purwa-ideacentre-mini-01q8x10, lenovo,ideacentre-mini-01q8x10,
  qcom,x1p42100

Assisted-by: Grok 4.5 (xAI)
Signed-off-by: Jens Glathe <jens.glathe@oldschoolsolutions.biz>
Signed-off-by: Tobias Heider <tobias.heider@canonical.com>
Signed-off-by: Paolo Pisati <paolo.pisati@canonical.com>
Ledger-Change: C-00307
Ledger-Origin: ubuntu@eda09778c49b017ca2a1bef9920027b068e19b9f
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml | 11 ++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
index 21ae9227d91f..453af5bf6aeb 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
@@ -1178,6 +1178,11 @@ properties:
           - const: qcom,x1e001de
           - const: qcom,x1e80100
 
+      - items:
+          - const: lenovo,hamoa-ideacentre-mini-01q8x10
+          - const: lenovo,ideacentre-mini-01q8x10
+          - const: qcom,x1e80100
+
       - items:
           - enum:
               - lenovo,thinkpad-t14s-lcd
@@ -1210,7 +1215,6 @@ properties:
               - hp,elitebook-6-g1q
               - hp,elitebook-ultra-g1q
               - hp,omnibook-x14
-              - lenovo,ideacentre-mini-01q8x10
               - lenovo,yoga-slim7x
               - microsoft,romulus13
               - microsoft,romulus15
@@ -1229,6 +1233,11 @@ properties:
           - const: microsoft,denali
           - const: qcom,x1e80100
 
+      - items:
+          - const: lenovo,purwa-ideacentre-mini-01q8x10
+          - const: lenovo,ideacentre-mini-01q8x10
+          - const: qcom,x1p42100
+
       - items:
           - const: microsoft,surface-pro-12in
           - const: qcom,x1p42100
